{"ID":"20240118151311-r7zt2yz","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151311-r7zt2yz","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151311-r7zt2yz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151311-u3svrr4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122094613-xdmnued\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122094613-xdmnued\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:116,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:116\u0026#125;","title":"078杜若","type":"doc","updated":"20240129161632"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151311-u3svrr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151311-u3svrr4","updated":"20240122094559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛微温，主胸胁下逆气，温中风，入脑户，头肿痛，多涕泪出，久服益精明目，轻身。一名杜衡。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094601-635x562","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094601-635x562"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】山中阴地之多年生草，叶做心脏形，似细辛，惟经冬不凋，与细辛异，根入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094603-u3v5sjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094603-u3v5sjn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛，性温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094605-vz757gn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094605-vz757gn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】杜衡主治发热头痛，能催吐，近世用者不多。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094608-mfqbwy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094608-mfqbwy3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】止气奔喘促，消痰饮，破留血，项间瘿瘤之疾。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094609-uagcl9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094609-uagcl9l"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【括要】下气杀虫，利小便，发汗通经，将根末吹入鼻中，能做轻嚏。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094611-smz0bad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094611-smz0bad"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通五分至一钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094612-zkp8qvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094612-zkp8qvz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】使人呕恶，不宜多用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094612-6ttir0l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094612-6ttir0l"}},{"ID":"20240122094613-6arqwpq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094613-6arqwpq"}},{"ID":"20240122094613-xdmnued","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094613-xdmnued","updated":"20240129161632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第78味药，杜若。现在也称为杜衡，那现在这个药，很少很少人会去使用它，用的不多了。那这个药呢，过去使用在，甄权呢，他在喉咙的这个甲状腺肿啊，我们有非常多的药可以治疗那个肿哦，这个药现在很少使用。那这个诸位可以看一看就好了，看看，《神农本草经》里面有好些药现在已经没有人认得了哦。"}]}]}